{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023880/extras/5c93af49fa9cc99b6135cda35adca98b.webp?t=1770752228\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023880/extras/5c93af49fa9cc99b6135cda35adca98b.poster.avif?t=1770752228\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=356 /></picture></span><br>Sometimes it\u2019s hard to figure out what is real and what is a phantom of a fevered mind.<br>Despite all the attempts to leave the past behind the aftershocks of childhood experiences keep haunting the lead character depriving him of all the rest. That made Artem face his fears and come back to his hometown \u2013 the cradle of his nightmares \u2013 looking for the only man who could understand him and was always there for him in his darkest hours. But the home ground meets Artem chilly: he starts seeing things in the gloom of a half-forgotten town, and all roads lead to a local landmark \u2014 a yellow house, which threatens to turn into a trap for anyone who crosses its threshold.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023880/extras/a06ef3125b0cc2f71f75b4766fbf1ca7.gif?t=1770752228\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023880/extras/a06ef3125b0cc2f71f75b4766fbf1ca7.poster.avif?t=1770752228\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br>Yellow House is a non-linear visual novel in the psychological horror genre. The story takes place in a town surrounded by thick woods in the far north. It\u2019s a place where you can't trust anyone, maybe even yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023880/extras/c0066e62ac7776915e7ce9869665235e.gif?t=1770752228\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023880/extras/c0066e62ac7776915e7ce9869665235e.poster.avif?t=1770752228\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Enthralling gruesome story, which will make you doubt the reality of what is happening. <br></li><li> 1-bit-styled graphics will immerse you into a gloomy atmosphere of desperation. <br></li><li> Original soundtrack.<br></li><li> Plot twists.<br></li><li> Disturbing, oppressive atmosphere. <br></li><li> Distinctive characters.<br></li><li> Multipath narration. Be careful with choices.<br></li><li> Help the main character stay sane. Or prevent him from doing it.<br></li><li> Try not to die.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023880/extras/cc5d824b317728e4b75bda4369151e9e.avif?t=1770752228\" width=600 height=146 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3023880?t=1770752228","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770752228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023880/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770752228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023880/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770752228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains content not suitable for all ages or for viewing at work: violence and gore, mature content, mentions of suicide and self-harm, mentions of alcohol use, partial nudity."},"demos":[{"appid":3171600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023880/extras/5c93af49fa9cc99b6135cda35adca98b.webp?t=1770752228\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_